MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: dd971a789047b4178a648ed59238c7b7, type: 3}
  m_Name: WitchHunterDialogue
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Witch.Infrastructure::Witch.Infrastructure.Content.WitchHunterDialogueDefinition
  stableId: dialogue.witchHunter
  stages:
  - accusations:
    - I am a Witch Hunter, sent to investigate this village.
    - I've received reports of harmful remedies from this shop.
    - Tell me, how did these remedies come to be?
    - Surely, there's a reasonable explanation, herbalist?
    successLine: Ah, never mind. I must have been mistaken.
  - accusations:
    - I am a Witch Hunter, and I have returned.
    - Another troubling report has reached my ears.
    - Are your practices truly free from forbidden arts?
    - Or is there something you're keeping from me?
    successLine: Strange... what was I questioning you about?
  - accusations:
    - Witch Hunter, at your service. We meet again.
    - More harmful remedies! This cannot be mere carelessness.
    - Have you been meddling with forbidden arts?
    - Answer me truthfully, herbalist!
    successLine: Wait... why was I so suspicious of you?
  - accusations:
    - The Witch Hunter returns... again.
    - How many times have I visited this wretched shop?
    - These harmful remedies continue to plague this village!
    - Confess! What exactly are you hiding?
    successLine: Good heavens... why am I standing here again?
  - accusations:
    - I am a Witch Hunter, and I demand answers!
    - I suspect dark forces are at work in this shop.
    - Are you truly an honest herbalist, or something else?
    - By the Crown, confess your true identity!
    successLine: What was I doing here? I have matters elsewhere!
